		<title>Madonna Is Still Better Than You.</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-still-better/20150216</link>
		<comments>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-still-better/20150216#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Mon, 16 Feb 2015 17:31:03 +0000</pubDate>
