				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>To celebrate <strong>Madonna</strong>’s upcoming new album <strong><a href="http://www.swide.com/celebrities/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna/2014/08/16" target="_blank">Swide Magazine</a></strong> has asked three of her (crazy) fans to compile the definitive list of reasons to still love the undisputed <strong>Queen of Pop</strong>.<br />
There’s little to discuss, because at 56, <strong>Madonna</strong> is still, in the world of pop music, the unattainable First Lady or Queen or whatever other title you may wish to use to describe her.<br />
Which one do you like the most?<br />
Check it out: </p>
<p><em>1. Because of the utter pointlessness of this list. Even today, the title pop star still only means one thing: Madonna. After a career spanning 30 years her name is still on everybody’s lips, it is a point of reference for every pop artist and her stadium tours are always a sell out.</p>
<p>2. Because she has always sung pretty badly, but no one has ever found that a problem. So much so that even as her voice ages, no one pays any attention.</p>
<p>3. Because, unlike all the other pop stars in the solar system, she has never been caught out by the paparazzi doing something stupid, but all the scandals that she has created have been invented ad hoc.</p>
<p>4. Because she is always friends with some of the coolest sorts around.</p>
<p>5. Because she has been excommunicated several times, and throughout her career she has managed to get up the noses of the representatives of many religions.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-religion.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>6. Because she discovered Alanis Morrisette (now stop pulling that face, Jagged Little Pill is one of the best records of the nineties).</p>
<p>7. Because, before getting that damn fringe, she couldn’t get it wrong, when it came to her hair, that is.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-hairstyle-2.jpg" alt="null" /><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-hairstyle-1.jpg" alt="null" /><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-best-hairstyles-3r.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>8. Because there is for certain someone right now who is listening to her music somewhere on the planet. Has it ever happened to you? There you go, it has to her. For 30 years.</p>
<p>9. Because, did you know that she has an IQ of 140?</p>
<p>10. Because she is Miss Discipline.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-miss-discipline.gif" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>11. Because her censored work American Life is a masterpiece. Let’s take another look:</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/sNAw3f5VXA8?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>12. Because of that time when she really wound David Letterman up.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/S1Ksc2uHL6o?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>13. Because of that time (sic. MTV Video Music Awards 1995)  when Courtney Love had had one drink too many and threw a shoe at her and Madonna reacted by saying “Courtney Love is in need of attention”.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/TBTl611c9fs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>14. Because of Ray Of Light.</p>
<p>15. Because her roots are Italian.</p>
<p>16. Because she donated money following the Earthquake in Abruzzo, from where her family originally came.</p>
<p>17. Because nobody knows how to be “costumy” like her:</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-costumy.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>18. Because of the way she opened the fan during her performance of Vogue at the MTV Awards in 1990. And for that performance in general.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/lTaXtWWR16A?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>19. Because the look with which she opened her last tour was the black version of wedding gown worn the day she married Guy Ritchie:</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-guy-ritchie-wedding-dress.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>20. Because anything that any other female pop star does, she already did it at least 10 years before.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-lady-gaga-copy.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>21. Because the “Born This Way” – “Express Yourself” diatribe with Lady Gaga was pretty much enjoyable. In particular, when Madonna did a mash up between the two songs during the MDNA tour.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/I4Y4xvG3gbM?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>22. Because of the video of Express Yourself: CIAO.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/IxNBaoWrbzs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>23. Because with Erotica / SEX she rewrote the concept of provocation in pop culture. She raised the bar to a point that no one will ever be capable of reaching.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-sex-book.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>24. Because when I’m sad and I go to a disco to let off steam by dancing, I think that the”Confessions on a Dance Floor” are mine.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-Confessions-on-a-Dance-Floor.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>25. Because of that gay marriage thing at the Grammy awards in 2014, I got really emotional.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/MRdn7u-sTfA?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>26. Because she is doing a great job with Lourdes and Rocco.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-lourdes-rocco.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>27. Because she posts on Instagram as a fourteen year old who is going to see Lana Del Rey.</p>
<p>28. Because she gets politically involved, at the cost of proving unpopular with someone.</p>
<p>29. Because for years she has proved that pop music is a deadly serious matter.</em></p>
<p><em>30. Because of her stoicism, that she has put into her acting career first, and then as a director. No one believes in it, be she does, a lot.</p>
<p>31. Because in the end she did win a Golden Globe for Evita. Have you got one? No? Then hush your mouth.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-golden-globe-evita.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>32. Because, in principle, she doesn’t give a hoot about everything and everyone.</p>
<p>33. Because she is the patron saint of DJs: even now her hits help to save millions of dj-sets in crisis.</em></p>
<p><em>34. Because she does however provide employment for a thousand or so people.</p>
<p>35. Because she always surrounds herself with only the “best” in order to create, and she knows how to work with them.</p>
<p>36. Because she is the only pop star with a career spanning 30 years that has not yet surrendered to living off her best hits or horrid unreleased tracks and every ten years.</p>
<p>37. Because Elton John hates her.</em></p>
<p><em>38. Because at the age of 56 she had twenty-year-old lovers with whom I, at the age of 30, wouldn’t even get a look in.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-young-boyfrined.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>39. Because she has never worn a pair of flat shoes, has not ridden on public transport since 1984, cannot leave her house on her own and only washes dishes in Dolce &#038; Gabbana photos.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-dolce-gabbana-dish-washing.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>40. Because musically she has given us numerous masterpieces (Like a Prayer, True Blue, Ray Of Light, Confessions on a Dance Floor).</p>
<p>41. Because, after a negligible release (Hard Candy) and one that looked as though it had promise but appeared to be unfinished (MDNA), we all hope that the next album will be a new masterpiece.</p>
<p>42. Because of the Blonde Ambition Tour.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-Blonde-Ambition-Tour.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>43. Because she has never lost it. Ever.</p>
<p>44. Because she can’t do anything but does everything to perfection.</em></p>
<p><em>45. Because from Sean Penn to Tony Ward, with Guy Ritchie and Basquiat along the way, she has an unrivalled list of exes.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-boyfriends-sean-penn-tony-ward-basquiat.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>46. Because she does not have a star on the Walk of Fame because “she wasn’t interested.”</p>
<p>47. Because at 56 she dances like an 18-year-old.</p>
<p>48. Because, before embarking on her career, she too did menial work. She also worked for Dunkin Donuts, but was fired for having sprayed jelly into a customer’s face.</em></p>
<p><em>49. Because when Madonna asked Bjork to write a song with her, Bjork said no. But then Madonna’s producer stepped in, and Bjork agreed to write a song for her. The result is Bedtime Story, in which Bjork uses the lyrics to criticise Madonna’s appearance. But which she, Madonna, decided not to change and to sing it just the same.</em></p>
<p><em>50. Because of the video Bedtime Story. So much money so very well spent.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/CSaFgAwnRSc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>51. Because of the crucifixion on Swarosvky’s cross in Confession Tour.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/2JvK3U2gpsQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>52. Because of Steven Klein,</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-steven-klein.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>Mario Testino,</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-mario-testino.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>David LaChapelle,</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-david-la-chapelle.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>Steven Meisel,</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-steven-meisel.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>Helmut Newton,</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-Helmut-Newton.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>Mert &#038; Marcus.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-mert-and-marcus.jpg" alt="null" /><br />
<em>She has been a muse for some of the greatest photographers in history.</em></p>
<p><em>53. Because now I’ll show you the video of Like A Virgin and then I want to see if you can avoid humming it for the next 16 hours.</em></p>
<p><span class='embed-youtube' style='text-align:center; display: block;'><iframe class='youtube-player' type='text/html' width='960' height='570' src='http://www.youtube.com/embed/s__rX_WL100?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;fs=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;wmode=transparent' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen='true'></iframe></span></p>
<p><em>54. Because the “performed” piece in Gang Bang, one of the opening numbers on MDNA, the one that seems to be the pursuit of a Tarantino movie, is crazily cool.</em><br />
<img src="http://ffaasstt.swide.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/56-reasons-to-still-love-madonna-gang-bang.jpg" alt="null" /></p>
<p><em>55. Because I have a dream that one day someone will put together a photo gallery of ALL her looks.</p>
<p>56. <strong>Because she is Madonna, period</strong>.</em></p>
